orer, without drag & dropping into the editor window?","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3678841291/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3679597804","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114218#issuecomment-3679597804","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114218","id":3679597804,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7bUjTs","user":{"login":"Nallebeorn","id":7013489,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwMTM0ODk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7013489?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nallebeorn","html_url":"https://github.com/Nallebeorn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nallebeorn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nallebeorn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nallebeorn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nallebeorn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nallebeorn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nallebeorn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nallebeorn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nallebeorn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nallebeorn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-21T21:57:56Z","updated_at":"2025-12-21T21:57:56Z","body":"> Can you also confirm if the same behavior happens when adding assets to the project outside of Godot through file explorer, without drag & dropping into the editor window?\n\nFor the behaviour I could reproduce, it doesn't. It only happens when dragging a folder already in the Godot project from File Explorer to the editor window at the same location (so when the import source and target paths are the same, I suppose). It doesn't happen if I say drag-and-drop a folder with the same name and contents from some other source directory into the project directory, whether to the editor or to a file explorer window.\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3679597804/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3704627957","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114218#issuecomment-3704627957","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114218","id":3704627957,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7c0CL1","user":{"login":"onequid","id":49135017,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5MTM1MDE3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/49135017?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/onequid","html_url":"https://github.com/onequid","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onequid/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onequid/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onequid/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onequid/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onequid/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onequid/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onequid/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onequid/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onequid/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-02T06:55:36Z","updated_at":"2026-01-02T16:11:29Z","body":"It's reproduced in Windows with a non-mono build from master. In my case, there's a popup with 