dot/blob/05c097e5e29d32bff50cf8cfa46576c932afd32a/core/io/dir_access.cpp#L413-L414\n\nIt is not working properly as the \"from\" and \"to\" paths compared are not in the same format.\nSince it is in the core module, I just commited in my fork instead of creating a pull request:\nhttps://github.com/onequid/godot/blob/d7d85c202cc108002baf8d923eab97062effb31a/core/io/dir_access.cpp#L413-L418\n\nOr the from path could be formatted here?\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/05c097e5e29d32bff50cf8cfa46576c932afd32a/editor/editor_node.cpp#L6802-L6808","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3705748482/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3706457267","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114218#issuecomment-3706457267","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114218","id":3706457267,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7c7Ayz","user":{"login":"rsubtil","id":6501975,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1MDE5NzU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6501975?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil","html_url":"https://github.com/rsubtil","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-02T23:15:02Z","updated_at":"2026-01-02T23:15:02Z","body":"From what I noticed in your patch, the issue is a mismatch of `\\` and `/` separators. If this is indeed the root cause of OP's issue, I think the solution should be in both places:\n- Rework the check in `copy` to standardize both paths (using [simplify_path](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/classes/class_string.html#class-string-method-simplify-path) already replaces `\\` with `/`)\n- Find the root cause in `_add_dropped_files_recursive` for the path separator mismatch, because with the above change Godot would just now spam errors.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3706457267/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3706780088","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114218#issuecomment-3706780088","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114218","id":3706780088,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7c8Pm4","user":{"login":"onequid","id":49135017,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5MTM1MDE3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/49135017?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/onequid","html_url":"https://github.com/onequid","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onequid/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onequid/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onequid/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onequid/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onequid/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onequid/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onequid/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onequid/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onequid/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-03T05:29:50Z","updated_at":"2026-01-03T05:29:50Z","body":"First of all, as I cannot reproduce the folder duplication even in 4.6-Beta1 Mono, I'm not sure if this would fix the OP's issue. \nWas there any other key pressed?\n\nIt would fix the godot freeze and avoid creating tmp files after the drag and drop action.\n\nWhen would the standardization of paths be done usually? Right after their creation, I guess?\n\nAnd thanks for referring to `simplify_path`, it's just what I need.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3706780088/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]